adr: 0364
file: selfhost/compiler.pas
kills: foreign-width
why: The emitter declares a slice's count as i64 on every target again, which cdecl forgives on i386 and the ABI does not. The emitter half of foreign-width reads the declaration back for i386 and requires ptr, i32.
--- old
          if PtrSize = 8 then write(ircode, 'ptr, i64')
          else write(ircode, 'ptr, i32')
--- new
          write(ircode, 'ptr, i64')
